Mathetic PBC (Delaware File No. 7731904)

This is a courtesy reminder from your registered agent.

Delaware corporations must file an Annual Franchise Tax Report and pay franch=
ise tax by March 1, 2027.

- Public benefit corporations must include the biennial statement on the publ=
ic benefit in their report.
- The minimum tax under the Assumed Par Value Capital Method is $400; the fil=
ing fee is $50.
- Late filings incur a $200 penalty plus interest of 1.5% per month.

You can file through the Delaware Division of Corporations website or ask us =
to file on your behalf.

Harbor Registered Agents, Compliance Team

